        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "随后，她负于科斯秋克，止步马德里8强，罗马止步第四轮。法网首轮，又以五比七、六比七负于萨卡里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0c233d571616fb3e9a8896c6c933e58a5a5d56d0fc27d222020580a60548d4a4",
      "words_sha256": "e7305488e21a894e6d781ed109ac1cad550f0ae8817b6a06b792b701058388e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1cc2c0382892fd594198ae72d98d1fbffaf421df60d4d90f174dbd1103314915",
      "request_id": "1cc2c0382892fd594198ae72d98d1fbffaf421df60d4d90f174dbd1103314915",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c597d28d11093c10d4e27e419b20a26c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "迈阿密首战失利，斯图加特打进8强。马德里，她抢七击败高芙，晋级8强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8cf2bbc8d81ed3f46b94e7d9f84550e168500c3f84cdeaaf97bab01ed0d36b74",
      "words_sha256": "bdc05bf339fb02dfc0ad07d84a9152ab0876effa1452e9030bc18a54f87ec790"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2f084dec306743d9c36ee94ded5094ecdf91252762f0a20c6c1d03e92377e574",
      "request_id": "2f084dec306743d9c36ee94ded5094ecdf91252762f0a20c6c1d03e92377e574",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "573afc9a18d284b5ad2f65a8d19a7417",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七月十一日，诺斯科娃在温网登顶。但她的年终之路，还要从一月讲起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "047e9918758ece6ddd20cb48ea9536e61d5c6607fbf20fd56870b8d5752f9930",
      "words_sha256": "7d6923777cbf48210254808f34ae71471d43f276b64a8943b5283b5b39d3b40f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:37de62b0910f5ca19b935a90282188e1b4c7d30479ce2d1c90f64e62b0cfa804",
      "request_id": "37de62b0910f5ca19b935a90282188e1b4c7d30479ce2d1c90f64e62b0cfa804",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f1b5ecf92e44204094f03a7e3910aef9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网夺冠后的晚宴上，她把感谢留给母亲。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "da93ab98297a90b526223db661384e9d7f12a4ae8a3595b144e8f9b9e42867e8",
      "words_sha256": "84adaa61794069277af2a7110f6f761c6edb8c713d165afaa34eefddb8dfc977"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:640ba396e95e5cf9cc14c645d8bb454bf6131296e13734b0b5b5428fbdac8734",
      "request_id": "640ba396e95e5cf9cc14c645d8bb454bf6131296e13734b0b5b5428fbdac8734",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a590c08c0bddb8d7acb78a0435c52256",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九月，她帮助捷克夺得比利简金杯。北京止步第四轮后，北京时间十月九日，官方确认她首次入围年终。十一日，她因左小腿受伤退出武汉。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b8a86e17c2aac48727646c5839709f5299dd74c9c93a84cfe27bccdb1239b148",
      "words_sha256": "56de806be1b49403380a5d3431d1c1aaf9b6d8633ee25794eb083a404f940b97"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a9441c3d8786b114494beb8f7711822608ba8c3b620bd86df5aa6ea052cc7be6",
      "request_id": "a9441c3d8786b114494beb8f7711822608ba8c3b620bd86df5aa6ea052cc7be6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "91e60f6d4b219d46eae305f612e54529",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北美夏天，多伦多首战出局，辛辛那提止步第四轮。美网，她第一次打进8强。再次面对萨巴伦卡，胜负直到决胜盘抢十才揭晓。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e6a34c17d5d74f3b4ab1d94c17f5fa0248f80d022576af447419ef226d8107be",
      "words_sha256": "7498cf4163195005fb9dc57b79329ae6ee9faf694990d7a00f1dc19084cfdd31"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b041a70fc73f1ee0c1424a16543898bccce99a1c8f84322d0ee0491db97f5063",
      "request_id": "b041a70fc73f1ee0c1424a16543898bccce99a1c8f84322d0ee0491db97f5063",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9de3a35254570018d3ba02052421bfd0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一次年终，她会带来怎样的惊喜？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e49fe710bf45aaf8cd1035cf81abdb85da76359cf30a2dc1694e6eddb29ea12a",
      "words_sha256": "e3d770ee1d1a939549bfe8bdf8b68be1ada7f29f64e8ec93ce0ff23a7c0565a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b660a8a6679e4949204fec25e1fd51805853da615074ee75d8d011fe579a2ded",
      "request_id": "b660a8a6679e4949204fec25e1fd51805853da615074ee75d8d011fe579a2ded",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6d90ce9a8f03e2f3ca7e18df904f931b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴特洪堡首轮出局后，她来到温网。跨过凯斯、梅尔滕斯和科斯秋克，她首次打进大满贯决赛。最后一关，是朋友穆霍娃。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0ebe97bca11c490d1cf4b39454b0d0f125f6801d0ad2b644f05c08c2b290befc",
      "words_sha256": "be0d6957773659f1c09f268427e23919b4acee588928b7f79e9d9316137a9176"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7a3a0a50808c47121774d198c34f84ccc9670bff740e06aacde9ed15be30987f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cdb2093adedbaf5feb4089f863141fb26b3c614ce775825e2f0119255d5b4698",
      "request_id": "cdb2093adedbaf5feb4089f863141fb26b3c614ce775825e2f0119255d5b4698",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "371475a08053dba2c8c24f0d19c963e4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二十六天后，故事转向草地。伯林决赛，她三盘击败佩古拉，拿到本季首冠，也是生涯第二冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d5c804032881fe475a6cb4aab04972fbd36217a72f5ed1acddeaf21f74ddb4ca",
      "words_sha256": "04da4068bd0f63fbe8189adb53812e7c26f25d0d4eafa46f38746cb9c0615337"
    },
